{"url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/courses.php", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/courses.php", "text": "Courses | B.H. College\nRTI\n|\nFeedback\n|\nOnline Portal\n|\nLMS\n|\nLogin\n|\nProspectus 2024-25\n|\nUndertaking\n|\nSSR\n|\nPeer Team Report\n|\nNAAC Certificate\nHome\nAbout\r\n                                                BHC\nAbout College\nMission & Goal\nMessage From Principal\nCode of Conduct\nProcedure & Policies\nAdministrative Committee\nCourses Offered\nAcademics\nFaculties\nArts\nCommerce\nScience\nCells & Committees\nCourses\nAdmission\nExaminations & Results\nMOU\nBoards of Studies\nAcademic Calendar\nFYUGP NEP20 Curriculum\nAdministration\nPrincipal\nCommittees\nTeaching Staff\nNon-Teaching Staff\nLibrary Staff\nGoverning Body\nInstitutional Plans & Policies\nCode of Conduct\nLibrary\nIQAC\nAnti-Ragging\nICC\nCourses Offered:\nDue to structural changes in the course curriculum delivered by the HEI, at present there are three different types of batches under UNDERGRADUATE PROGRAMME. These include:\n1.\tThe fifth and sixth semester’s students of the session 2024 have to follow the course structure as per the CBCS of Gauhati University. The details of this structure are available at the following link:\nhttps://syllabus.gauhati.ac.in/ug/ug-cbcs-regulations\n.\n2.\tThe third and fourth semesters students of the session 2024–25 need to follow the FYUGP course structure of  Gauhati University which has been designed under the guideline of NEP. The details of this structure are available at the following link:\nhttps://nep.gauhati.ac.in/home.\n3.\tFrom the academic session 2024-25 onwards the institution will be following the NEP-FYUGP course structure of Bhattadev University. The details of this structure are available at the following link:\nhttps://bhattadevuniversity.ac.in/tdc_courses.jsp\nDetail of the Courses offered by the Institution\nContact Us\nAddress\nBH College, Howly Road,\nBarpeta, Assam\nE-mail\n[email protected]\nTelephone\n+91 9435513261\nImportant Links\nAHSEC\nNATIONAL ACADEMIC DEPOSITORY\nNATIONAL DIGITAL LIBRARY\nUGC\nSWAYAM\nUseful Links\nONLINE PORTAL\nNSP\nVirtual Lab\nVaccancy In Assam\nNPTEL\nCopyright © 2022 B.H. College\nPowered By\nS.S.\r\n                Technologies\n| Terms and Conditions", "links": [{"label": "RTI", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/upload/rti/Statutory Declaration under RTI.pdf"}, {"label": "Feedback", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/feedback_btn.php"}, {"label": "Online Portal", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/admission_link.php"}, {"label": "LMS", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/lms.php"}, {"label": "Login", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/login.php"}, {"label": "Prospectus 2024-25", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/upload/prospectus/1715577158.pdf"}, {"label": "Undertaking", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/undertaking.php"}, {"label": "SSR", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/ssr.php"}, {"label": "Peer Team Report", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/Peer Team Report.pdf"}, {"label": "NAAC Certificate", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/NAAC Certificate 2025.pdf"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/index.php"}, {"label": "Home", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/index.php"}, {"label": "About\r\n                                                BHC", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/courses.php"}, {"label": "About College", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/about.php"}, {"label": "Mission & Goal", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/vision&mission.php"}, {"label": "Message From Principal", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/principal.php"}, {"label": "Code of Conduct", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/code_conduct.php"}, {"label": "Procedure & Policies", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/policies.php"}, {"label": "Administrative Committee", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/committee.php"}, {"label": "Courses Offered", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/courses.php"}, {"label": "Academics", "url": "https://bhcollege.ac.in/courses.php